ine-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606272338558093_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606272338558093_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-01/match1867459date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">晋级16强！法国3-0瑞典将战巴拉圭 姆巴佩双响奥利塞两助攻+中柱</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260701/zhanbao_image_1867459_1782859337_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260701/zhanbao_image_1867459_1782859337_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260701/zhanbao_image_1867459_1782859337_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">姆巴佩双响，奥利塞两送助攻。最终法国3-0淘汰瑞典晋级世界杯16强，1/8决赛将对阵巴拉圭。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-01/match1867460date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">绝杀晋级16强！挪威2-1科特迪瓦将战巴西 哈兰德绝杀努萨世界波</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260701/zhanbao_image_1867460_1782846606_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260701/zhanbao_image_1867460_1782846606_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260701/zhanbao_image_1867460_1782846606_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">哈兰德推射破门完成绝杀，最终挪威2-1科特迪瓦晋级16强，将战巴西。</span></p><p><strong><span style=" 51, 51);">【世界杯动态】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-01/6a43efc5a7cb1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世界杯1/8决赛对阵：巴西vs挪威，维尼修斯、哈兰德正面交锋</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a4410986418b.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a4410986418b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a4410986418b.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">2026美加墨世界杯1/16决赛，挪威击败科特迪瓦成功晋级16强，他们将在1/8决赛中对阵巴西。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-01/6a444672ae539native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">前两届冠军+亚军！法国完胜瑞典轻松晋级，连续三届晋级16强</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a444ad862a56.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a444ad862a56.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a444ad862a56.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">美加墨世界杯1/16决赛，法国战胜瑞典，晋级世界杯16强！1/8决赛法国将对阵巴拉圭，比赛将在7月5日5点打响。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-01/6a43c5b4c8ccenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">追平队史最佳战绩！挪威晋级世界杯16强，时隔28年重返16强</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a440978de179.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a440978de179.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a440978de179.jpg"> </div><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a441c702e613.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a441c702e613.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a441c702e613.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">本届是挪威队史第四次征战世界杯决赛圈，此前他们的最好成绩是1998年世界杯与1938年的16强。时隔28年重返世界杯舞台，挪威再度打进16强，追平队史最佳战绩。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-01/6a442f7ad2de4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">带队止步世界杯32强！官方：科曼宣布辞职，不再担任荷兰队主帅</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a443526e9efd.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a443526e9efd.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a443526e9efd.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">官方消息，荷兰主帅科曼在社媒宣布辞职，不再担任橙衣军团主帅。昨天世界杯1/16决赛，荷兰加时1-1点球大战2-3不敌摩洛哥，止步世界杯32强。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-01/6a443d81ac312native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">距梅西只差1球！姆巴佩双响18场18球，继续紧追梅西19球纪录</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a4444d437c69.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a4444d437c69.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a4444d437c69.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">世界杯1/16决赛，法国vs瑞典。姆巴佩再进一球，本场梅开二度，打进个人世界杯第18粒进球！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-01/6a443a0305201native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">9场10球！姆巴佩世界杯淘汰赛打入10球，超越大罗历史最多！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a4445ea5ce5b_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a4445ea5ce5b.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260701/6a4445ea5ce5b.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">姆巴佩18场世界杯打入18球，其中小组赛9场8球，淘汰赛9场10球。姆巴佩也以10球成为世界杯淘汰赛阶段的最佳射手！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-01/6